        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 916S, Modern Door Lever Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMinamalistic in design, this door handle made by Omnia is sure to add a chic touch to any home. Not even the installation screws are visible, because this door lever latchset features concealed mounting screws. The most prominent trait of this door lever is the modern flat triangle embellishment on the handle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/modern-door-lever-with-round-rose-omnia-916-00\"><b> Modern 916 Omnia Door Lever With Round Rose</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ADA accessibility requirements.</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 916S Chic Square Rose Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose: 2-9/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door by using a 7mm solid spindle. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Uses 7mm split spindle. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Door Lever With Square Rose, Omnia 916S/00",
                "description": "Omnia 916S Modern Door Lever With Square Rose - Minamalistic in design, this door handle made by Omnia is sure to add a chic touch to any home. Not even the installation screws are visible, because this door lever latchset features concealed mounting screws. The most prominent trait of this door lever is the modern flat triangle embellishment on the handle. Available in 3 finishes.\r\n ",
